d [Code of Conduct](https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/main/CODE-OF-CONDUCT.md).\r\n- [x] You've included unit or integration tests for your change, where applicable.\r\n- [x] You've included inline docs for your change, where applicable.\r\n- [x] There's an open issue for the PR that you are making. If you'd like to propose a new feature or change, please open an issue to discuss the change or find an existing issue.\r\n\r\n**PR Title**\r\nThis fix will inspect EventCallback delegates tied to an attribute during render diffing to see whether the delegates point to a closure. In case of a closure, not a simple object.Equals call is performed, but the closure is inspected to see whether they capture the same variables. If this is the case, the EventCallback is replaced inside the .NET, instead of being added to the diff and communicated to the browser (either over SignalR, our through the WebAssembly JSInterop).\r\n\r\n**PR Description**\r\n\r\nThe PR contains the fix, as well as two components to inspect message sizes manually inside the browser, and dedicated unit tests.\r\n\r\nAddresses #31755\r\nAddresses #17886\r\n","labels":[{"id":1164776385,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTY0Nzc2Mzg1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/labels/area-blazor","name":"area-blazor","description":"Includes: Blazor, Razor Components","color":"5319e7","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2209519932,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMjA5NTE5OTMy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/labels/community-contribution","name":"community-contribution","description":"Indicates that the PR has been added by a community member","color":"c2e0c6","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2021-04-13T15:30:05Z","updated_at":"2023-12-08T19:51:31Z","closed_at":"2021-11-05T09:23:21Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"89eff88a178dd73295fdd24377afef728220a895","assignee":{"login":"Stev